# IIQ AngularJS + XHTML File Placement

## JavaScript / AngularJS (Legacy Frontend)

Located in `web/ui/js/`. This is the **AngularJS 1.8** codebase — separate from modern Angular in `web/ui/ts/`.

| File type | Location | Example |
|-----------|----------|---------|
| **Shared directive** | `web/ui/js/common/directive/` | `spDatePicker.js` |
| **Shared service** | `web/ui/js/common/service/` | `DateValidationService.js` |
| **Shared filter** | `web/ui/js/common/filter/` | `DateFormatFilter.js` |
| **Feature controller** | `web/ui/js/{feature}/` | `web/ui/js/certification/CertScheduleCtrl.js` |
| **Feature directive** | `web/ui/js/{feature}/directive/` | Only if NOT reusable across features |
| **Feature service** | `web/ui/js/{feature}/service/` | Only if NOT reusable across features |
| **Module registration** | `web/ui/js/{feature}/module.js` or `web/ui/js/common/module.js` | Register directive/service/filter here |

**Decision: shared or feature?**
- Used by 2+ features → `common/`
- Used by 1 feature only → `{feature}/`
- If unsure → start in `{feature}/`, move to `common/` when reused

**Decision: Angular 18 or AngularJS?**
- New feature being built → `web/ui/ts/` (Angular 18)
- Modifying existing feature → match what's already there (don't mix frameworks within a feature)

## XHTML Templates

| File type | Location | Example |
|-----------|----------|---------|
| **Page template** | `web/ui/page/{feature}/` | `certificationSchedule.xhtml` |
| **Shared include** | `web/ui/include/` | Reusable template fragments |
| **Widget** | `web/ui/js/common/directive/` | Directive template (inline or `templateUrl`) |

## Tests

| Test type | Location | Mirrors |
|-----------|----------|---------|
| **JS unit test** | `test/js/{feature}/` | Mirrors `web/ui/js/{feature}/` |
| **JS common test** | `test/js/common/` | Mirrors `web/ui/js/common/` |
